# Implementation Plan - Button View Mode in Bible Search Tab (Preview Pane)

This implementation plan outlines the changes required to add **Button View Mode** to the Preview Pane of the Bible Search tab (`lib/features/bible/presentation/widgets/bible_search_tab.dart`), strictly adhering to all user requirements and constraints.

---

## 1. Requirements Overview

- **Button View Mode (`_isButtonViewMode == true`)**:
  - Show a custom button view in the Preview Pane containing three side-by-side Button bars: `'Books'`, `'Chapters'`, `'Verses'` (default selection: `'Books'`).
  - In **'Books'** mode, display the exact row-by-row layout specified below:
    - **Old Testament** section header
    - Row 1: `'Gen'`, `'Exo'`, `'Lev'`, `'Num'`, `'Deut'`
    - Row 2: `'Josh'`, `'Judg'`, `'Ruth'`, `'1 Sam'`, `'2 Sam'`
    - Row 3: `'1 Kin'`, `'2 Kin'`, `'1 Chr'`, `'2 Chr'`
    - Row 4: `'Ezra'`, `'Neh'`, `'Esth'`
    - Row 5: `'Job'`, `'Psa'`, `'Pro'`, `'Eccl'`, `'Songs'`
    - Row 6: `'Isa'`, `'Jer'`, `'Lam'`, `'Eze'`, `'Dan'`
    - Row 7: `'Hos'`, `'Joel'`, `'Amos'`, `'Obad'`
    - Row 8: `'Jona'`, `'Mica'`, `'Nah'`, `'Hab'`
    - Row 9: `'Zeph'`, `'Hag'`, `'Zech'`, `'Mal'`
    - A line gap
    - **New Testament** section header
    - Row 1: `'Mat'`, `'Mark'`, `'Luke'`, `'John'`
    - Row 2: `'Acts'`, `'Rom'`, `'1 Cor'`, `'2 Cor'`
    - Row 3: `'Gal'`, `'Eph'`, `'Philp'`, `'Col'`
    - Row 4: `'1 Thes'`, `'2 Thes'`, `'1 Tim'`, `'2 Tim'`
    - Row 5: `'Titus'`, `'Philm'`, `'Heb'`, `'Jam'`
    - Row 6: `'1 Pet'`, `'2 Pet'`, `'1 Jhn'`, `'2 Jhn'`, `'3 Jhn'`
    - Row 7: `'Jude'`, `'Rev'`
- **List View Mode (`_isButtonViewMode == false`)**:
  - Unchanged UI and functionality in the Preview Pane (continues showing selected verse previews and existing controls).

