4. Confirm side-by-side `'Books'`, `'Chapters'`, `'Verses'` button bars appear with `'Books'` active by default.
5. Verify the OT and NT book layout match all specified rows.
6. Click a Book button -> verify chapter view opens -> click Chapter button -> verify verse view opens -> click Verse button -> verify selection is updated.
7. Switch back to **List View Mode** -> verify exact original Preview Pane UI and verse text list are preserved.
